From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gezim <gezimos@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 20:00:00 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] Kompakt: the LED colour is picked on one bar of named colours

The light dialog's square and vertical hue strip were hard to use on
the e-ink panel, and users picked dark colours there that the LED
showed as something else.

The hue is now picked on one horizontal bar that snaps to 36 hues at
full strength, and a second bar of the same height below it, drawn as a
white to black dither, lightens the colour toward white.
Dimming stays with the brightness setting. The picked colour's name sits
above them. The old picker stays hidden as the colour's holder, so
saving, the LED preview and restore are unchanged; the hex field goes
with it.
---
